  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'>\n<div>Includes:</div>\n<div><ul>\n<li>contour land</li>\n<li>contour land approximate</li>\n<li>contour land auxiliary/interpolated</li>\n<li>contour land depression</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div>In southern Ontario the contour interval is 5 meters. In the near north the contour interval is 10 meters. In the Far North the contour interval depends on the information source.</div>\n<div><br /></div>\n<div>*Due to limitations of the shapefile format, Contour data can only be downloaded in the file geodatabase format. On Ontario GeoHub, access a file geodatabase by clicking Download &gt; Additional Resources &gt; Complete File Geodatabase.</div> \n<div> <br /> </div>\n<div> <strong>Additional Documentation<br /></strong></div>\n<div><ul>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Contour%20-%20User%20Guide.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Contour - User Guide (Word)</a><br /></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Contour - Data Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Contour - Data Description (PDF)</a></li>\n\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Contour - Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Contour - Documentation (Word)</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div><strong>Status</strong><br /></div>\n<div> </div><div>Completed: production of the data has been completed<br /> </div>\n<div> <br /> </div>\n<div> <strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency<br /> </strong> </div>\n<div>As needed: data is updated as deemed necessary<br /> </div>\n<div> <br /> </div>\n<div> <strong>Contact<br /> </strong> </div>\n<div>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - GeospatialOntario, <a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>geospatial@ontario.ca </a> </div></span>"
